# Acceptance stub detection

Root cause (2026-11-19): Test Architect often kept `def test_acceptance_pending` while also adding real tests → HITL `tests_not_runnable` / "acceptance stub not replaced".

Treat as stub only when `not generated yet` remains, or when `test_acceptance_pending` is the only test. Prompt must still require deleting/renaming the stub name.
